Z||000000||SeanyD||08-07-2000||05:52 PM||||alright everyone...I need a hand here.....I read a post on here that theres a way to replace the clutch through the wheel well of the car....I read the directions, but they were pretty confusing..not the problem though...I need to find them again....any ideas would be great...also...how would I get the back cradle bolt off if the head was stripped throughly ( gotta love being the third or fourth owner of the car)<BR>any help would be great||||reg||1
Z||000001||EdsB52||08-07-2000||06:48 PM||||Of all the clutches I've done on Fieros, only once did I do it without pulling the craddle. To me, it was much more work than just pulling the whole thing. It can be done, but I ended up breaking the O2 sensor and bending the exhaust a little. After all was said and done, it took me the same amount of time as pulling the craddle. I'm sure someone has a trick to it, but for me, I'll pull the whole thing.||||reg||1
Z||000002||SeanyD||08-09-2000||02:46 AM||||if it weren't for the bolt that I can't figure how to get out...I'd just drop it as planned..but yeah....can't get the cradle without cuttiung the bolt.....thenm how do I cut the bolt??||||reg||1
Z||000003||dman||08-09-2000||04:00 AM||||Hi SeanyD. I'm assuming that the cradle bolt that is causing you problems is in the rear. If so, then several solutions to that type of problem have already been answered here on the forum.<P>Should you want to drop the cradle then I'd suggest taking a die grinder to the head bolt. If that works then I'd also suggest performing a search on the forum for suggestions on how to repair that nut inside the rail.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Indiana_resto_guy||08-09-2000||10:51 AM||||For the bolt!<P>Invest in a set of 'Metrinch' sockets.<BR>These are universal S.A.E. and metric bolts and nuts. They work very well on rounded off items. I have a set and am VERY impressed with them!||||reg||12
Z||000005||SeanyD||08-10-2000||01:16 PM||||thanks guys, I'll take a look and see was trouble I can cause later..thanks again!||||reg||1
